# ============================================================
# PobTools — .gitignore
# ============================================================

# --- Build outputs -----------------------------------------
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.log
*.tlog/
x64/
Debug/
Release/

# pob-zh-engine build tree (CMake) and deployment bundle
pob-zh-engine/build/
pob-zh-engine/vcpkg/
pob-zh-engine/tests/translate_test_out.txt

# dist/ is the deployment bundle — a build output, so it stays ignored, with one
# exception: the translation dictionaries. Those ship in the public release zip
# already, and keeping them here is what lets an outside translator fork the
# repo, edit a dictionary and open a PR.
#
# ⚠ This MUST be written as `dist/*` plus per-level re-includes, never as
# `dist/` plus `!dist/Data/...`. Git does not descend into a directory that is
# excluded as a whole, so a `!` line underneath one would match nothing and the
# dictionaries would stay invisible — silently, with no error to explain it.
#
# Each re-included directory needs its parent re-included first, hence the
# Data/ line before the Data/* line.
pob-zh-engine/dist/*
!pob-zh-engine/dist/Data/
pob-zh-engine/dist/Data/*
!pob-zh-engine/dist/Data/poe1/
!pob-zh-engine/dist/Data/poe2/
!pob-zh-engine/dist/Data/launcher/
!pob-zh-engine/dist/Data/filter_items_zh.json
!pob-zh-engine/dist/Data/item_meta.json
!pob-zh-engine/dist/Data/item_classes_zh.json

# The set above mirrors $dataGlobs in tools/package_release.ps1 and
# IsTranslationDataRel() in host/app_update.cpp — the same "what counts as
# translation data" boundary, now expressed a third time. Keep them in step.
# One deliberate difference: atlas_versions/*/atlas_tree_zh.json is in the
# packaged set but NOT here. Atlas data is fetched and rebuilt by the in-app
# updater and filtered by the prune/fresh machinery, so a hand-edited copy in
# the repo would be overwritten or stripped at load time rather than take
# effect. Translating the atlas is not a PR-shaped job.

# Editor backups, wherever they land. The translation editor writes a .bak
# beside every dictionary it saves, and those sit inside the re-included
# directories above — this line is what keeps them out.
*.bak

# Release packaging output
dist-release/
dist-portable/

# --- Reference / external checkouts (kept local, not uploaded) ---
PathOfBuilding-SimpleGraphic/
atlastree-export/
originalPOB/
contentGGPK/
DebugView/
LibGGPK3-main/
skilltree-export-*/
/Data/

# --- Translation data-generation pipeline (maintainer-only, kept local) ---
/update-translations.bat
/tools/
pob-zh-engine/tools/
/docs/ggpk-translation-pipeline.md

# --- Not part of the public PobTools release (kept local only) ---
/poeMarketTranslate/
# poe-price-check 是獨立產品且有自己的 git repo 與 MIT 授權(大量移植
# Awakened PoE Trade),不隨 PobTools 一起發布。
/poe-price-check/
/poe-price-check-spec.md
# apt-patched(awakened-poe-trade-zh-TW)同理:它是上游 SnosMe 專案的繁中 fork,
# 有自己的 git repo(Hsiung-Shao/awakened-poe-trade-zh-TW)、自己的 MIT 授權與
# 發版流程,只是放在這裡方便一起維護。**絕不可併進 PobTools 的版本控制**,
# 否則會把另一個 repo 的 1.7 GB(含 node_modules 與打包產物)拖進來。
/apt-patched/
# 譯文勘誤協作平台的開發規格。內含 Cloudflare 架構、D1 schema、授權模型與
# 防濫用設計 —— 公開等於把防線畫給要繞過它的人看。規格本身也還沒定案。
/poe-translation-hub-spec.md
/NeverSinkData/
/zh-rTW/
/filter/
/icon/
/CLAUDE.md
/.vscode/
/docs/analysis/
/docs/notes/
/remove/

# --- Misc --------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
graphify-out/
image/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
